## <a name="how-to-use"></a>🚀 4. select_relatedの使い方

### Step 1: models.pyでForeignKeyを定義

```python
# models.py
class MGroup(models.Model):
    group_code = models.CharField(primary_key=True, max_length=50)
    group_name = models.CharField(max_length=100)
    
    class Meta:
        db_table = 'm_group'

class MUser(models.Model):
    user_id = models.CharField(primary_key=True, max_length=50)
    username = models.CharField(max_length=50)
    
    # ★ForeignKeyを定義★
    group = models.ForeignKey(
        MGroup,                    # 参照先のモデル
        on_delete=models.CASCADE,
        db_column='group_code'     # DBのカラム名
    )
    #      ↑ Pythonの変数名
    
    class Meta:
        db_table = 'm_user'
```

### Step 2: views.pyでselect_relatedを使う

```python
# views.py
from common.models import MUser

# ✅ 正しい使い方
users = MUser.objects.select_related('group').all()
#                                    ↑ models.pyの変数名

for user in users:
    print(user.username, user.group.group_name)
    #                    ↑ SQLなし！すでに取得済み
```

### 実行されるSQL

```sql
SELECT 
    m_user.user_id,
    m_user.username,
    m_user.group_code,
    m_group.group_code,
    m_group.group_name
FROM m_user
INNER JOIN m_group 
    ON (m_user.group_code = m_group.group_code);
```

