## <a name="common-mistakes"></a>❌ 8. よくある間違い

### 間違い1: DBカラム名を指定

```python
# ❌ 間違い
users = MUser.objects.select_related('group_code')

# ✅ 正解
users = MUser.objects.select_related('group')
```

### 間違い2: select_relatedを忘れる

```python
# ❌ 悪い例（N+1問題）
users = MUser.objects.all()
for user in users:
    print(user.group.group_name)  # 毎回SQL実行

# ✅ 良い例
users = MUser.objects.select_related('group').all()
for user in users:
    print(user.group.group_name)  # SQLなし
```

### 間違い3: ManyToManyにselect_relatedを使う

```python
# models.py
class MUser(models.Model):
    groups = models.ManyToManyField(MGroup)  # 多対多

# ❌ 間違い
users = MUser.objects.select_related('groups')  # エラー！

# ✅ 正解（ManyToManyはprefetch_related）
users = MUser.objects.prefetch_related('groups')
```

### 間違い4: テーブル名を指定

```python
# ❌ 間違い
users = MUser.objects.select_related('m_group')

# ✅ 正解
users = MUser.objects.select_related('group')
```

