## 📚 補足資料

### select_related vs prefetch_related

| 項目 | select_related | prefetch_related |
|------|----------------|------------------|
| **対象** | ForeignKey, OneToOne | ManyToMany, reverse ForeignKey |
| **SQL** | INNER JOIN（1回） | 複数のSELECT（2回以上） |
| **用途** | 1対1、多対1 | 1対多、多対多 |

### パフォーマンス測定

```python
import time

# 測定1: select_relatedなし
start = time.time()
users = MUser.objects.all()
for user in users:
    _ = user.group.group_name
print(f"なし: {time.time() - start}秒")

# 測定2: select_relatedあり
start = time.time()
users = MUser.objects.select_related('group').all()
for user in users:
    _ = user.group.group_name
print(f"あり: {time.time() - start}秒")
```

